From 74cbc33dbf77a9415e4cc6d370cb6fdad4d2ec52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Vasconcelos <Felipe.Vasconcelos@windriver.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 09:38:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] zh-Hans enablement: catalog slots for credential panels and
 delete-confirm dialog

Create the Simplified Chinese (zh_Hans) message-catalog slots for the
Identity and Settings Credentials / User Credentials panels, the
Application Credentials create help paragraphs, and the two
delete-confirmation djangojs msgids used by the confirm dialog; and
un-fuzzy the Role/Roles plural so the AngularJS Roles panel title renders
with upstream's own existing translation.

These strings are wrapped in the Horizon source but absent from the
shipped 25.3.0 zh_Hans catalogs, and the Debian build compiles the shipped
.po without merging the extraction template, so without these slots the
strings cannot be translated by anyone. All new msgstr are left empty: the
strings keep English fallback today and become translatable by the
localization workflow. No translation content is authored here.

Signed-off-by: Felipe Vasconcelos <Felipe.Vasconcelos@windriver.com>
---
 horizon/locale/zh_Hans/LC_MESSAGES/djangojs.po            |   7 +
 openstack_dashboard/locale/zh_Hans/LC_MESSAGES/django.po  | 131 ++++++++++++++
 openstack_dashboard/locale/zh_Hans/LC_MESSAGES/djangojs.po |  1 -
 3 files changed, 137 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

